Conversion from v3.2 -to- v3.3 Notes:

  -+- All _Config.#? files have been shortened to just _#?:

      _Config.Added -> _Added
      _Config.Begin -> _Begin     etc.

  -+- No longer need _NoShow1st file.  Done internally!

  -+- Combined LoginConfig & LoginConfigRun into LoginConfig.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pre-v3.2 Conversion Notes:  (Use if previously used LogFig, not if
                            this is your first time.)

  -+- All _Config.#? files may remain as you have modified them.
      Make sure you have "_Config.NoShow1st" in your directory.

  -+- Replace the following files in your LogFig directory with those
      included in this archive:

      Login
      LoginConfig
      LoginConfig.guide
      LoginConfigRun
      MBNScan
      LF_Cut-n-Paste (if exists) with LF32_Cut-n-Paste

  -+- Delete OMR-Restore and LoginConfigReset (they are no longer used.)

  -+- Take out all references of OMR-Restore OUT of your BBSTEXT!

  -+- Make the necessary changes to your BBSTEXT using LF32_Cut-n-Paste.

  -+- Change the BBSMENU command for resetting from: (this is an example)

      LCRESET |{#1SN:LogFig/LoginConfigReset}

                     --TO--

      LCRESET |{#1SN:LogFig/SN_LoginConfig RESET}

  -+- If you used a previous version requiring the command added to
      all your _Config.#? files ({#0SN:LogFig/OMR-Restore CHECK}),
      then you need to REMOVE all of these lines.  Once done, you
      need to reset your users' configs (using LCR from your main
      menu).

  -+- You're done!  No need to reset your users' configs unless you
      fit into the above catagory.
